      "title": "REQUEST / PROMPT \u00b7 describe the new Instagram photo",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Create a full-color outdoor casual front-facing phone selfie of the exact same fictional adult woman shown in all three identity reference portraits. Preserve her recognizable facial identity, blue-gray eyes, long straight dark-blonde hair, facial proportions, and natural skin details. She is seated at a small European cafe table. The phone is held by her left hand at arm length, completely outside the frame; that selfie arm enters only from the lower-left edge and does not cross the top of the image. Her face and upper torso fill the vertical frame. Her right hand is completely visible beside her shoulder making a normal two-finger peace sign, with exactly two raised fingers and the other fingers naturally folded. Soft morning daylight comes from frame-left, with ordinary unretouched skin texture, a few flyaway hairs, slight exposure variation, restrained phone HDR, modest sharpening, faint JPEG compression, and subtle sensor noise. Use no beauty filter, studio lighting, cinematic grading, or portrait-mode cutout. The cafe background has believable optical focus falloff into foliage, tan walls and indistinct chairs."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "Create a full-color outdoor casual front-facing phone selfie of the exact same fictional adult woman shown in all three identity reference portraits. Preserve her recognizable facial identity, blue-gray eyes, long straight dark-blonde hair, facial proportions, and natural skin details. She is seated at a small European cafe table. The phone is held by her left hand at arm length, completely outside the frame; that selfie arm enters only from the lower-left edge and does not cross the top of the image. Her face and upper torso fill the vertical frame. Her right hand is completely visible beside her shoulder making a normal two-finger peace sign, with exactly two raised fingers and the other fingers naturally folded. Soft morning daylight comes from frame-left, with ordinary unretouched skin texture, a few flyaway hairs, slight exposure variation, restrained phone HDR, modest sharpening, faint JPEG compression, and subtle sensor noise. Use no beauty filter, studio lighting, cinematic grading, or portrait-mode cutout. The cafe background has believable optical focus falloff into foliage, tan walls and indistinct chairs."
      }
